---
layout: null
category: nomap
---
{%- comment -%}Índice de entradas: lo usan el buscador de la revista y la portada de mip.umh.es («Lo último en la revista»).
image: campo image de la entrada o, si no lo tiene, la primera imagen del texto. author_image: foto del autor en _data/authors.yml.{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for post in site.posts %}
  {%- assign img = post.image -%}
  {%- unless img -%}
    {%- assign trozos = post.content | split: '<img' -%}
    {%- if trozos.size > 1 -%}
      {%- assign tras = trozos[1] | split: 'src="' -%}
      {%- if tras.size > 1 -%}{%- assign img = tras[1] | split: '"' | first -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- assign autor = nil -%}
  {%- for a in site.data.authors -%}{%- if a[1].name == post.author.name -%}{%- assign autor = a[1] -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign autor_img = autor.image | default: post.author.image %}
  {
    "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
    "url": {{ post.url | prepend: site.baseurl | jsonify }},
    "date": "{{ post.date | date: "%d/%m/%Y" }}",
    "excerpt": {{ post.excerpt | strip_html | strip_newlines | jsonify }},
    "author": {{ post.author.name | jsonify }},
    "image": {{ img | jsonify }},
    "author_image": {% if autor_img %}{{ autor_img | prepend: "/images/" | prepend: site.baseurl | jsonify }}{% else %}null{% endif %}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
]
